    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDiatribes\u201d is a poetic VR interactive narrative that explores the internal conflicts surrounding climate change. In a 15-20 minute experience, players navigate a surreal mindspace filled with distractions and emotional turmoil. This dynamic world transforms based on your emotional state\u2014sometimes inviting contemplation through meditative tasks, while at other times thrusting you into a high-stakes gauntlet between Nature and Civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you journey through diverse landscapes, you\u2019ll unlock ancient myths and receive guidance from a therapeutic companion. The experience intertwines personal reflection with broader climate issues, encouraging players to confront their anxieties and envision a hopeful future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Narrative:</strong> A deeply engaging story that encourages personal reflection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments:</strong> Settings that change to reflect different emotional states, from serene to chaotic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meditative Tasks:</strong> Calming activities that foster introspection and peace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Myths &amp; Modern Insights:</strong> Timeless narratives that resonate with contemporary challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Therapeutic Guide:</strong> A unique companion providing perspective and support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDiatribes\u201d invites players to engage emotionally with climate realities, discovering personal agency amid uncertainty. Can you navigate the distractions and find a path forward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awards:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245570/extras/f8851edb824d05e30e4f772fee04cce8.avif?t=1737970861\" width=300 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245570/extras/59b8d84d3ccf513ff33769b61dcc3dd8.avif?t=1737970861\" width=300 height=179 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245570/extras/1f30755f4792304ee30074f26030baf9.avif?t=1737970861\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDiatribes\u201d is a poetic VR interactive narrative that explores the internal conflicts surrounding climate change. In a 15-20 minute experience, players navigate a surreal mindspace filled with distractions and emotional turmoil. This dynamic world transforms based on your emotional state\u2014sometimes inviting contemplation through meditative tasks, while at other times thrusting you into a high-stakes gauntlet between Nature and Civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you journey through diverse landscapes, you\u2019ll unlock ancient myths and receive guidance from a therapeutic companion. The experience intertwines personal reflection with broader climate issues, encouraging players to confront their anxieties and envision a hopeful future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Narrative:</strong> A deeply engaging story that encourages personal reflection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments:</strong> Settings that change to reflect different emotional states, from serene to chaotic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meditative Tasks:</strong> Calming activities that foster introspection and peace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Myths &amp; Modern Insights:</strong> Timeless narratives that resonate with contemporary challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Therapeutic Guide:</strong> A unique companion providing perspective and support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDiatribes\u201d invites players to engage emotionally with climate realities, discovering personal agency amid uncertainty. Can you navigate the distractions and find a path forward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awards:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.a